{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "7f64d45af75340a3b8fa440ae9d777c16592e9fbc781c3cf21a15aeaffc6ddcc", "ja": "Yeah　チェケラ開始", "zh": "Yeah　Check it out 开始", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e3fc430e63786e53c4cedd52874fa4144d2eafb0313fcbe73d58dda1246b79c7", "ja": "今までにないコンセプトのユニットを考える\nプロデューサー。律子、亜美、真美の3人を\n呼び出し、伝えたテーマは……ラップ！？\n言い合っているうち、自然とライムを刻んで\nしまう3人……準備はバッチリの様子！", "zh": "制作人思考着前所未有的组合概念。  \n召集了律子、亚美和真美这3人，  \n告诉她们的主题竟然是……说唱！？  \n争论着争论着，3人自然而然地开始押韵……看来已经准备得万无一失了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "71364e436e101eb1995f6611bac416cfeaf975997a5cfd3e85325eb19816bf8f", "ja": "（今日は新ユニットの初ミーティング。\n亜美、真美、律子……みんなもう来てるかな）", "zh": "（今天是新组合的第一次会议。\n亚美、真美、律子……大家已经来了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "b296d234edbfdb68fb4b86657479435f047cebd3d923c9e7f34de07247e50811", "ja": "……でね、兄ちゃんがここに座るっしょ、\nだからこのクッションをここに……。", "zh": "……然后呢，哥哥要坐在这里对吧，\n所以这个坐垫要放在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "9810f1c676c9cb6afdc21168ef9d005109c39f5498d5e9d39fb3bbf5f1a948db", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪\n兄ちゃん、ひっかかってくれるかなー。", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪\n哥哥会不会上钩呢——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4cdc01661c1d8ed87581ae7edfb01fdc7ca78f456607a4149cdd561bb25244a9", "ja": "……亜美、真美。俺はここにいるぞ。", "zh": "……亚美、真美。我在这儿呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "5dcec2ab20a5c88d79f74ef68daeb7b9985f685d2c33961c5aa503683aa302ad", "ja": "ぎくっ！！", "zh": "咯噔！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "5dcec2ab20a5c88d79f74ef68daeb7b9985f685d2c33961c5aa503683aa302ad", "ja": "ぎくっ！！", "zh": "咯噔！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "c0ec291a2fff8dee142f014470106f576a7f066c465d8cbf6d8e1941474f9d81", "ja": "亜美、真美！　私もいるわ。\nたくらみはすべて、お見通しよ。", "zh": "亚美、真美！我也在这儿呢。\n你们的盘算，我全都看穿了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "a6962b10675d6ddcd7246377d5e013ad3ba60c38e56da4ce52a0baf74c0d7670", "ja": "ちょ、兄ちゃん、律っちゃん！　ち、ちがうってば！\nこのクッションはね、えーと、その……。", "zh": "喂，哥哥，律子姐！不、不是那样啦！\n这个坐垫呢，呃……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "be65f7aadc8c5a57f07372b8e1c831eaf9ee54ff3cc50b92c388134992d76990", "ja": "兄ちゃんの腰をいたわるための、\n真美たちなりのシンセツってやつだよ？", "zh": "这是为了照顾哥哥的腰，算是我们真美的一点心意哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f5a80f5a941a9b40a2163671c73319ceca4b537cb728d6242425d660b9c5fe00", "ja": "引っかかってもいいけど、その\nブーブークッション、もう見飽きたぞ。", "zh": "中计倒是无所谓，不过那个\n放屁垫，我已经看腻了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "732728faa629f0579ddc5569a2df88e50ab4b7792855eabea54c9451e96ded1b", "ja": "ですよね……けど、たしかにフカフカなクッションね。\n座り心地は、案外悪くないかもしれませんよ？", "zh": "确实……不过，这个放屁坐垫还真是软乎乎的呢。  \n坐起来的感觉，说不定意外地还不错？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f02ae785f6a7a7ffcd5525281c5e215209a0ee7751076424def5115054260f52", "ja": "律子の勧めでも、座らないからな。\nとにかく、ミーティングを始めようか。", "zh": "就算律子你劝我，我也不会坐的。\n总之，先开始开会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "efeb2782324782eac440fdcd6db945e2c6bf2d1c46e03e19ac19b22b24cdd9f7", "ja": "この3人が呼ばれたってことは……亜美と真美に\n何かさせたくて、私は監視役ってところですか？", "zh": "既然叫来了这3个人……是想让亚美和真美做些什么，所以让我负责看着她们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5b578790ac3ad592ce121f822878d71c94b155e13a97eb1e57841d86c44f81c3", "ja": "そういうつもりじゃなかったんだけど、\n結果的に、半分当たっているような……。", "zh": "我本来没这个打算，不过结果看来……有一半算是说中了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "877b864c87cb87f95de721a9a0eafe3f0fa1c83602c807e2dc4dfeeb5712837f", "ja": "お願いです。勘弁してください。おしおき反対。", "zh": "拜托了。请饶了我吧。反对惩罚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "d688aa5b835211137a0aea78b5d7313d229b9ea56c8246f1fec57e327ab2d0e1", "ja": "うん。お手柔らかに……ね？　ハリセンはナシで。", "zh": "嗯。手下留情……好不好？可别拿纸扇打人哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "fff235fb3c0d33239f78afe4b3678a971ccbfd2bbc368784651223c0f2f5b553", "ja": "ちょっと！　まだ何もしてないでしょ、お互いに。", "zh": "等等！我们彼此都还什么都没做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7a00fe2afd7959d4ad280b9dc6345ebe6644820a22900cc366ca715451b0f90b", "ja": "亜美、真美、律子。今日みんなに集まってもらったのは\n他でもない。3人に、ユニットを組んで欲しいんだ。", "zh": "亚美、真美、律子。今天把你们叫来，不为别的，就是想让你们3人组成一个组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710", "ja": "へ？", "zh": "耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710", "ja": "へ？", "zh": "耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710", "ja": "へ？", "zh": "耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "6b2ddc66ff65ebea1c0daffde834eee6be8104c141bfdb4bdfdeb4efb51b3566", "ja": "へえ……。私と亜美と真美が。ユニット。\nこれは先が思いやられますね。……じーっ。", "zh": "哦……我、亚美和真美组成组合吗。看来以后会很让人担心呢。……盯——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "b4b5ca013dbc63d297feedceec84dc518d428f61afaeb1aadd039f9f8e5dc774", "ja": "ええっ……ど、どうする気なんだ、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "诶……你、你打算怎么办啊，哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "6e6a94305ecd072982788f522e1f974f92be0e016ecddd23943cc0b0cfa4ffb9", "ja": "ねえ！　亜美たち3人に、何をさせるつもりなの！", "zh": "喂！你打算让我们这3个人做什么啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "92cd5035d7ea086263a21248114d45df9110c7258ec38ff50cda3babfa6b1d46", "ja": "それなんだが……端的に言うと、ラップだ。", "zh": "是这样的……简单来说，就是说唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "453d5cb596878589dc4028694bbfd3f7d3eeaa2ba136b748af336d4f51109db4", "ja": "あー、はいはい。ラップね。最近のは高性能っしょ。\nパッと切れて、ベタベタしにくいんだよねー。", "zh": "啊～，知道知道。保鲜膜对吧。最近的保鲜膜性能可好了。\n唰地一下就能撕开，而且不容易粘在一起呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "785bbac02814ae251fff7bea18a9b6b8b301c97684e8f04ddbe985885d31e190", "ja": "真美、それ社長も言っていたが、違うぞ。\nそっちのラップじゃない。", "zh": "真美，社长也说过那个，不过不是那回事。不是你说的那种说唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "1c90cf6cd27adb9957f7ac5a7435dd662556874bf7871de919d73d360309ffff", "ja": "ラップって、その……\nヒップホップミュージックのラップ、ですか？", "zh": "你说的说唱，是指……\n嘻哈音乐里的说唱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "d150863296bcd9c3ab153e87742fafe2f96981d584ebd6b7bb8075f2264be806", "ja": "そうそう。いわゆる、YO、YO、っていう。あれだ。", "zh": "对对。就是那种，所谓的YO、YO。就是那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1029_009rit", "source_sha256": "0ae061a2d7301b34c88695afb971c9c3ce71c86a1304c3ef4d423b3c44aa9a62", "ja": "やっぱりそっちですよね。でも……そもそも、\nどうしてラップなんですか？　私達が。", "zh": "果然是那种啊。可是……话说回来，\n为什么偏偏要让我们去唱说唱啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "71717c06b1ebfef09eb70a74db4babf87a2114f0f05b34b30d171b06be38e0d4", "ja": "そこはその……新しい音楽ジャンルに挑戦という事で、\nピーンときたというか……。", "zh": "关于这个嘛……就当作是挑战全新的音乐类型吧，我就是突然灵光一现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "e853ff9838b0f022a4be9fc8d1fbc29db22fe5ce24ed3e8bfaceb0e0f92bfe30", "ja": "{$P$}？\nもしかして、適当に考えてませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}？\n你该不会……是在随口胡扯吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1032_011ami", "source_sha256": "de38a5e14b361d04f7638e5b1f9560a8f1313ba0a49ad35af726b612b2f3599c", "ja": "YO YO ……デュクデュク。チェケラッチョ。\nヘイYO　律っちゃん　カモンYO。", "zh": "YO YO……咚库咚库。Check it out。\nHey YO　律子　Come on YO。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "05bd521af6f11672593e505546e34308d75f06e619a788925dcabfca1e98109e", "ja": "亜美はいきなり何してんのYOー。\nミーティング、遊びじゃないのYOー。", "zh": "亚美突然这是在干什么哟——。开会可不是来玩的哟——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "4797688bd4080ed4c2237f023fa522bb89abfc7e5c8a59e37c440d05f6db35c2", "ja": "おっ、なんか今リズミカルなツッコミしたね。\nラップのノリって、こういうノリ？", "zh": "哦，刚才吐槽得挺有节奏嘛。\n说唱的感觉，就是这种感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1035_009rit", "source_sha256": "0dbdae15ff5ecee12ff27ed3209f8225af1ced84fb085a241ace9f5107f169ac", "ja": "あ、あれ……？　ちょっと面白い、かも……？", "zh": "啊，咦……？好像……有点有意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "8e8dcb9bdebd0de51565968a2203a9affa20791cb1d5ba09f828f3d4da045cdc", "ja": "アイドルがきちんとラップできたら、新しい表現に\nなるんじゃないかと思ってるんだ。どうかな？", "zh": "如果偶像能好好地进行说唱，我觉得或许能成为一种全新的表现形式。你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "1a98a104c134f4a899445909b985c018c5f3ed4a6011267ee191f7a3cd6009d1", "ja": "たしかに、新しくはありますけど……そうですね。\nどうせやるからには、きちんと取り組まないと。", "zh": "确实很新颖，不过……是啊。\n既然要做，就得认真对待才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1038_011ami", "source_sha256": "30b6f94db1ddbb048630261bd1b81cca0d454b7e4c56e00b3dd7222fc6d17149", "ja": "まあ、きちんとっていうか、\nやるなら亜美も面白くしたいかな。", "zh": "嗯，与其说要认真对待，不如说既然要做，亚美也想把它变得有趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1039_012mam", "source_sha256": "6d5db9307815f086364afab5e213f36897875d1f7dc43c0a5168b6ea29127fa9", "ja": "なんか楽しみじゃんYO。\n斬新かもじゃんYO。じゃじゃーんYO。", "zh": "感觉很让人期待嘛YO。\n说不定会很新颖嘛YO。锵锵——YO。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1040_011ami", "source_sha256": "e01390a61a11426296fa4049b40a2c5be2c5ca81d8527dcf620324f3d455d6d6", "ja": "包まれたラップから破る、それがアイドルラップ！", "zh": "从包裹住的说唱中挣脱出来，这就是偶像说唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "7c080a02245c99d9137cb371c1288215c015e46be3d20dddb206484e73c4379e", "ja": "（さて、既にノリは良さそうだが……）", "zh": "（嗯，感觉大家已经很有干劲了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1042_009rit", "source_sha256": "e7d61d87dd493ee30115558dbdda0a0e5556a0f52a795e030c1e4d55888ccd63", "ja": "その……YOとか、多分表層に過ぎないと思うので。\nもっとリサーチが必要じゃないですか？", "zh": "那个……像“YO”之类的，我觉得可能只是表面功夫而已。\n是不是还需要进一步调查？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1043_009rit", "source_sha256": "7baa8995f591ef675bf81611c28f9fda45401680e218783e312a58871e9329bb", "ja": "{$P$}。私は資料を集めて、\nヒップホップのことを学んでみます。", "zh": "{$P$}。我会收集资料，试着了解嘻哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1044_p", "source_sha256": "20ce2d973c815ab1008e150f2edf2f841c9dd31816ec46d384d8c39eb4f1a329", "ja": "資料研究か。律子らしいアプローチだな。\nよし、まかせた。", "zh": "研究资料吗。很像律子的做法啊。好，交给你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1045_012mam", "source_sha256": "7d8a6d9efbe4b799a67e03a6db84ea2ccf219b18dcc8319acac7e6e1ac02c920", "ja": "よし！　まかせた！", "zh": "好！交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1046_011ami", "source_sha256": "7d8a6d9efbe4b799a67e03a6db84ea2ccf219b18dcc8319acac7e6e1ac02c920", "ja": "よし！　まかせた！", "zh": "好！交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1047_009rit", "source_sha256": "5f688a04b62c7c7df1007203fe7770425c5b10b0941a805ee7cfcd60e2d03829", "ja": "あのね、亜美、真美？　あなた達もレッスンするの。\n冗談やイタズラなんてやってる暇はないのよ？", "zh": "那个，亚美、真美？你们也要参加训练哦。\n可没时间开玩笑或恶作剧吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1048_011ami", "source_sha256": "1e0c01c6194ce3e6c1b241944860e68e03bc8ac453ab5fe3ffa8167470be1c6f", "ja": "ぐえーっ！　りょ、了解！！", "zh": "呃啊——！了、了解！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1049_012mam", "source_sha256": "1faff69ef1413d06dfd360286dad102d9201ad83db353f553ccc443a869685d8", "ja": "やはりオニだ……鬼軍曹……地獄の特訓が……。", "zh": "果然是恶鬼……鬼军曹……地狱特训要开始了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1050_009rit", "source_sha256": "c46cddf3212137cf81fcfcad6a7a0209d4443401890db8993b67b358a0d45b48", "ja": "軍曹って、私はまだ何もしてませんからね。\nふふっ、でも楽しみだわ。ふたりとも覚悟しなさい。", "zh": "都说是军曹了，可我还什么都没做呢。呵呵，不过我很期待哦。你们两个做好觉悟吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_01_1051_p", "source_sha256": "828aa84659a0cf6420409dca1601ebfca9d03ccd199cf1c39593d40eba64178c", "ja": "（……やっぱり、面白いユニットになりそうだ。\n色々と模索も必要だけど、頑張っていこう）", "zh": "（……果然，会成为一个很有意思的组合呢。\n虽然还需要各种摸索，但一起努力吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
